WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:02.500
A few weeks later, yarn goes up.

2
00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:08.300
Every yarn has a review date, so
Weavly tells you when a rate is due.

3
00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:11.200
If a price hasn't moved, just confirm it.

4
00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:15.300
This one has gone up: Edit rate,
type the new price, and save.

5
00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:21.733
Activity shows how that yarn's
rate has moved over time.

6
00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:25.000
Now, Propagate.

7
00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:31.500
Every costing that uses this yarn gets a new
version, with the new rate worked in. No rebuilding.
